cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Footprint-Creater"
abstract: >-
  Automatic building footprint extraction from high-resolution orthophotos.
  HRNet semantic segmentation with block-wise inference and Nodata masking,
  followed by geometry-aware post-processing (area filtering, hole filling,
  mitre-join smoothing, Douglas-Peucker simplification, rectangularisation).
  Outputs georeferenced Shapefiles. Includes a Flask console with per-stage
  previews and pretrained HRNet-W32/W48 checkpoints.
authors:
